{"The `grafana` case in the `.map()` render (lines 156-163) omits the `key` prop on `GrafanaRuleListItem`, while the `datasource` and default cases both include `key={key}`. This causes React to use index-based keys, leading to reconciliation issues when rules are added, removed, or reordered\u2014potentially preserving stale state in the wrong components.": 0.9750810861587524, "The `DeletePermanently` action at line 328 uses `isAlertingRule` (which only matches alerting rules) instead of checking for any Grafana-managed rule. This causes the action to be incorrectly marked as unsupported for Grafana recording rules, even though they should also be permanently deletable. Should use `prometheusRuleType.grafana.rule(rule)` to include both alerting and recording rules.": 0.8641842603683472}